# 3D validation against a closed-form solution.
#
# The regression cases pin the solver against its own previous output, which
# catches changes but cannot say the answers were ever right. This one checks
# the solver against mathematics instead.
#
# On the unit square with u = 0 held on all four sides, pure diffusion with
# D = 1 has the separable solution
#
#     u(x,y,z,t) = sin(pi x) sin(pi y) sin(pi z) exp(-3 pi^2 t)
#
# since du/dt = -3 pi^2 u and D grad^2 u = -(pi^2 + pi^2 + pi^2) u. It is an
# eigenfunction, so the profile decays in place without changing shape, and
# 3 pi^2 = 29.608813203268074.
#
# A single subdomain covers the whole domain, so there is no embedded boundary
# and no membrane condition to perturb the solution -- the analytic result then
# holds exactly, and what remains is discretisation error.
#
# The time step is deliberately small. At a coarse dt the backward-Euler error
# dominates, and it has the opposite sign to the error from an overstated
# diffusion coefficient -- the two cancel, and a 5% error in D actually lowers
# the measured deviation. Driving the time error down to the same order as the
# spatial one removes that blind spot: a 2% error in D then shows up ten times
# over.
#
# The solver evaluates the EXACT expression itself and records "max error" and
# "relative L2 error" as HDF5 attributes; tests/CMakeLists.txt asserts on those.
SIMULATION_PARAM_BEGIN
SOLVER CHOMBO_SEMIIMPLICIT_SOLVER
BASE_FILE_NAME SimID_analytic3d_0_
TIME_INTERVALS 1
0.01 0.0001 50
STORE_ENABLE 1
SIMULATION_PARAM_END

MODEL_BEGIN
FEATURE cyt 0 value value value value value value
MODEL_END

CHOMBO_SPEC_BEGIN
DIMENSION 3
MESH_SIZE 16 16 16
DOMAIN_SIZE 1.0 1.0 1.0
DOMAIN_ORIGIN 0.0 0.0 0.0
SUBDOMAINS 1
cyt 0
IF -1.0;
USER 1.0;
REFINEMENTS 1 1
MAX_BOX_SIZE 16
BLOCK_FACTOR 8
FILL_RATIO 0.9
RELATIVE_TOLERANCE 1.0E-11
VIEW_LEVEL 0
SAVE_VCELL_OUTPUT true
SAVE_CHOMBO_OUTPUT false
CHOMBO_SPEC_END

VARIABLE_BEGIN
VOLUME_PDE U cyt false false false
VARIABLE_END

COMPARTMENT_BEGIN cyt
BOUNDARY_CONDITIONS value value value value value value
EQUATION_BEGIN U
INITIAL (sin((3.141592653589793 * x)) * sin((3.141592653589793 * y)) * sin((3.141592653589793 * z)));
EXACT (sin((3.141592653589793 * x)) * sin((3.141592653589793 * y)) * sin((3.141592653589793 * z)) * exp( - (29.608813203268074 * t)));
RATE 0.0;
DIFFUSION 1.0;
VELOCITY_X 0.0;
VELOCITY_Y 0.0;
VELOCITY_Z 0.0;
BOUNDARY_XM 0.0;
BOUNDARY_XP 0.0;
BOUNDARY_YM 0.0;
BOUNDARY_YP 0.0;
BOUNDARY_ZM 0.0;
BOUNDARY_ZP 0.0;
EQUATION_END
COMPARTMENT_END
